<title>USA: Group holds 6.7 pct stake in Redwood Trust.</title>
<headline>Group holds 6.7 pct stake in Redwood Trust.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>An investor group including Zweig-DiMenna Partners LP told regulators Wednesday that it holds a 6.7 percent stake, or 990,000 common shares, in Mill Valley, Calif.-based Redwood Trust Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the New York-based group said its latest transactions include the purchase of shares between June 11 and August 4 at prices ranging from $41.67 to $52.61 a share.</p>
</text>
